[
  {
    "index": 0,
    "text": "[Gabby gasps]"
  },
  {
    "index": 1,
    "text": "♪ Meow, meow, meow, meow, meow ♪"
  },
  {
    "index": 2,
    "text": "♪ Hey, Gabby ♪"
  },
  {
    "index": 3,
    "text": "♪ Take us to the Dollhouse ♪"
  },
  {
    "index": 4,
    "text": "♪ Hey, Gabby ♪"
  },
  {
    "index": 5,
    "text": "♪ Little by little"
  },
  {
    "index": 6,
    "text": "Let's live in the meow ♪"
  },
  {
    "index": 7,
    "text": "♪ Meow, meow, meow, meow, meow, meow ♪"
  },
  {
    "index": 8,
    "text": "♪ Meow, meow, meow, meow, meow, meow ♪"
  },
  {
    "index": 9,
    "text": "♪ Meow, meow, meow, meow, meow ♪"
  },
  {
    "index": 10,
    "text": "-♪ Hey, Gabby ♪"
  },
  {
    "index": 11,
    "text": "-♪ Meow, meow, meow, meow ♪"
  },
  {
    "index": 12,
    "text": "-♪ What's the big surprise? ♪"
  },
  {
    "index": 13,
    "text": "-♪ Meow, meow ♪"
  },
  {
    "index": 14,
    "text": "♪ Let's shrink right down and go inside ♪"
  },
  {
    "index": 15,
    "text": "♪ Hey, Gabby ♪"
  },
  {
    "index": 16,
    "text": "♪ Meow ♪"
  },
  {
    "index": 17,
    "text": "Oh, hi! Do you want to see"
  },
  {
    "index": 18,
    "text": "what Pandy and I are making?"
  },
  {
    "index": 19,
    "text": "Okay. Let me just add"
  },
  {
    "index": 20,
    "text": "one more dab of my trusty glue."
  },
  {
    "index": 21,
    "text": "And..."
  },
  {
    "index": 22,
    "text": "ta-da!"
  },
  {
    "index": 23,
    "text": "It's a squishy little cushy."
  },
  {
    "index": 24,
    "text": "I made all different shapes and sizes"
  },
  {
    "index": 25,
    "text": "so that we can make"
  },
  {
    "index": 26,
    "text": "all kinds of new things"
  },
  {
    "index": 27,
    "text": "for our party room."
  },
  {
    "index": 28,
    "text": "We can use our cushions"
  },
  {
    "index": 29,
    "text": "to make a rocket, ready to blast off."
  },
  {
    "index": 30,
    "text": "Or we can make"
  },
  {
    "index": 31,
    "text": "a skateboard."
  },
  {
    "index": 32,
    "text": "Whee!"
  },
  {
    "index": 33,
    "text": "And if we stack our cushions"
  },
  {
    "index": 34,
    "text": "like this,"
  },
  {
    "index": 35,
    "text": "we get a squishy, cushy chair."
  },
  {
    "index": 36,
    "text": "Oh! And are you ready"
  },
  {
    "index": 37,
    "text": "to see my favorite part?"
  },
  {
    "index": 38,
    "text": "They glow!"
  },
  {
    "index": 39,
    "text": "Is that cat-tastic, or what?"
  },
  {
    "index": 40,
    "text": "-♪ Meow, meow, meow, meow, meow! ♪"
  },
  {
    "index": 41,
    "text": "-Oh! You know what that sound means."
  },
  {
    "index": 42,
    "text": "It's time for a Dollhouse Delivery."
  },
  {
    "index": 43,
    "text": "Come on."
  },
  {
    "index": 44,
    "text": "♪ Meow, meow, meow ♪"
  },
  {
    "index": 45,
    "text": "♪ Meow ♪"
  },
  {
    "index": 46,
    "text": "♪ Meow ♪"
  },
  {
    "index": 47,
    "text": "♪ Meow ♪"
  },
  {
    "index": 48,
    "text": "I wonder what our Meow Meow Mailbox"
  },
  {
    "index": 49,
    "text": "has for us today. Let's see."
  },
  {
    "index": 50,
    "text": "-[muffled disco music playing]"
  },
  {
    "index": 51,
    "text": "-Ooh."
  },
  {
    "index": 52,
    "text": "I don't know what's on the inside,"
  },
  {
    "index": 53,
    "text": "but it looks like a party on the outside."
  },
  {
    "index": 54,
    "text": "-[party horns honking]"
  },
  {
    "index": 55,
    "text": "-Whoa!"
  },
  {
    "index": 56,
    "text": "It is a party!"
  },
  {
    "index": 57,
    "text": "A party for a new kitty. [gasps]"
  },
  {
    "index": 58,
    "text": "Oh, look how adorable he is,"
  },
  {
    "index": 59,
    "text": "with his fluffy hair,"
  },
  {
    "index": 60,
    "text": "his fun party hat,"
  },
  {
    "index": 61,
    "text": "and his cute sneakers with wheels on them."
  },
  {
    "index": 62,
    "text": "Whee!"
  },
  {
    "index": 63,
    "text": "I wonder what his name is."
  },
  {
    "index": 64,
    "text": "Oh! There's a note."
  },
  {
    "index": 65,
    "text": "\"My name is Marty the Party Cat,"
  },
  {
    "index": 66,
    "text": "and I heard that you had"
  },
  {
    "index": 67,
    "text": "a new party room in the Dollhouse."
  },
  {
    "index": 68,
    "text": "I was really hoping"
  },
  {
    "index": 69,
    "text": "you could show me around."
  },
  {
    "index": 70,
    "text": "Pretty, pretty please,"
  },
  {
    "index": 71,
    "text": "with confetti on top?\""
  },
  {
    "index": 72,
    "text": "Hmm. What do you think?"
  },
  {
    "index": 73,
    "text": "Should we take Marty the Party Cat"
  },
  {
    "index": 74,
    "text": "into the Dollhouse"
  },
  {
    "index": 75,
    "text": "to show him our new party room?"
  },
  {
    "index": 76,
    "text": "Let's do it."
  },
  {
    "index": 77,
    "text": "Okay."
  },
  {
    "index": 78,
    "text": "Here you go, Marty."
  },
  {
    "index": 79,
    "text": "Hey, he looks pretty good in there,"
  },
  {
    "index": 80,
    "text": "don't you think?"
  },
  {
    "index": 81,
    "text": "We'll be right in, Marty."
  },
  {
    "index": 82,
    "text": "It's time to get tiny."
  },
  {
    "index": 83,
    "text": "♪ A pinch on my left"
  },
  {
    "index": 84,
    "text": "Pinch, pinch on my right ♪"
  },
  {
    "index": 85,
    "text": "♪ Grab Pandy's hand and hold on tight! ♪"
  },
  {
    "index": 86,
    "text": "I'm up here..."
  },
  {
    "index": 87,
    "text": "[party horn honks]"
  },
  {
    "index": 88,
    "text": "...in the party room."
  },
  {
    "index": 89,
    "text": "Come on in."
  },
  {
    "index": 90,
    "text": "Welcome to the Dollhouse party room."
  },
  {
    "index": 91,
    "text": "[party horn honks]"
  },
  {
    "index": 92,
    "text": "I hope you're ready to party, Marty."
  },
  {
    "index": 93,
    "text": "Marty?"
  },
  {
    "index": 94,
    "text": "Pandy?"
  },
  {
    "index": 95,
    "text": "Hmm. Looks like"
  },
  {
    "index": 96,
    "text": "we need to find Marty and Pandy."
  },
  {
    "index": 97,
    "text": "Tell me if you see them."
  },
  {
    "index": 98,
    "text": "[muffled laughter]"
  },
  {
    "index": 99,
    "text": "Behind me?"
  },
  {
    "index": 100,
    "text": "[muffled laughter]"
  },
  {
    "index": 101,
    "text": "I don't see them."
  },
  {
    "index": 102,
    "text": "[in unison] Party hug attack!"
  },
  {
    "index": 103,
    "text": "[Gabby laughs]"
  },
  {
    "index": 104,
    "text": "-Wahoo-hoo!"
  },
  {
    "index": 105,
    "text": "-Paw-esome!"
  },
  {
    "index": 106,
    "text": "Hiya, everybody."
  },
  {
    "index": 107,
    "text": "Wow, Marty!"
  },
  {
    "index": 108,
    "text": "You just got here, and you're already"
  },
  {
    "index": 109,
    "text": "throwing your first party."
  },
  {
    "index": 110,
    "text": "Yep!"
  },
  {
    "index": 111,
    "text": "I'm part-cat..."
  },
  {
    "index": 112,
    "text": "and all party!"
  },
  {
    "index": 113,
    "text": "♪ Ooh-hoo! ♪"
  },
  {
    "index": 114,
    "text": "Well, then you're gonna feel"
  },
  {
    "index": 115,
    "text": "right at home in the party room."
  },
  {
    "index": 116,
    "text": "Check this out."
  },
  {
    "index": 117,
    "text": "Oh, Party Tail!"
  },
  {
    "index": 118,
    "text": "[gasps] A Party Tail?"
  },
  {
    "index": 119,
    "text": "Yep."
  },
  {
    "index": 120,
    "text": "With this Party Tail,"
  },
  {
    "index": 121,
    "text": "we can change the room"
  },
  {
    "index": 122,
    "text": "to whatever kind of party we want."
  },
  {
    "index": 123,
    "text": "Like a robot party."
  },
  {
    "index": 124,
    "text": "[gasps] Whoa!"
  },
  {
    "index": 125,
    "text": "Beep-bop, beep-bop, boop-be-boop!"
  },
  {
    "index": 126,
    "text": "I love a..."
  },
  {
    "index": 127,
    "text": "[in robotic voice] ...robot party."
  },
  {
    "index": 128,
    "text": "Or a pirate party."
  },
  {
    "index": 129,
    "text": "[ship bell clangs]"
  },
  {
    "index": 130,
    "text": "Ooh! Ahoy mateys!"
  },
  {
    "index": 131,
    "text": "-[in unison] Arr!"
  },
  {
    "index": 132,
    "text": "-[Marty laughs]"
  },
  {
    "index": 133,
    "text": "Or..."
  },
  {
    "index": 134,
    "text": "a space party."
  },
  {
    "index": 135,
    "text": "Out of this world!"
  },
  {
    "index": 136,
    "text": "That Party Tail is confetti-riffic!"
  },
  {
    "index": 137,
    "text": "Do you want to give it a try?"
  },
  {
    "index": 138,
    "text": "Wait. Really?"
  },
  {
    "index": 139,
    "text": "Whoa!"
  },
  {
    "index": 140,
    "text": "Swing that Party Tail, Marty."
  },
  {
    "index": 141,
    "text": "[gasps]"
  },
  {
    "index": 142,
    "text": "♪ Ooh-hoo! ♪"
  },
  {
    "index": 143,
    "text": "-Whoa! Check it out."
  },
  {
    "index": 144,
    "text": "-[elephant bellows]"
  },
  {
    "index": 145,
    "text": "I made a jungle party."
  },
  {
    "index": 146,
    "text": "Talk about party animals."
  },
  {
    "index": 147,
    "text": "[mimics monkey chittering]"
  },
  {
    "index": 148,
    "text": "Way to go, Marty!"
  },
  {
    "index": 149,
    "text": "You're a natural."
  },
  {
    "index": 150,
    "text": "Thanks."
  },
  {
    "index": 151,
    "text": "And we're back."
  },
  {
    "index": 152,
    "text": "Wow!"
  },
  {
    "index": 153,
    "text": "You know, I never had a tail before."
  },
  {
    "index": 154,
    "text": "But if I did,"
  },
  {
    "index": 155,
    "text": "I'd want it to be just like that one."
  },
  {
    "index": 156,
    "text": "Do you want to try it on?"
  },
  {
    "index": 157,
    "text": "Ooh! Ooh! Doodly-do I!"
  },
  {
    "index": 158,
    "text": "Oh."
  },
  {
    "index": 159,
    "text": "Oh..."
  },
  {
    "index": 160,
    "text": "No worries. I've got you."
  },
  {
    "index": 161,
    "text": "-There."
  },
  {
    "index": 162,
    "text": "-What do you think, Marty?"
  },
  {
    "index": 163,
    "text": "♪ Whoo-hoo-hoo! ♪"
  },
  {
    "index": 164,
    "text": "I feel good!"
  },
  {
    "index": 165,
    "text": "It does look pretty cat-tastic."
  },
  {
    "index": 166,
    "text": "Like it was made for you."
  },
  {
    "index": 167,
    "text": "Oh, yeah! Party-riffic!"
  },
  {
    "index": 168,
    "text": "[Gabby laughs]"
  },
  {
    "index": 169,
    "text": "Okay, Marty, how would you like to see"
  },
  {
    "index": 170,
    "text": "the rest of the party room?"
  },
  {
    "index": 171,
    "text": "Pretty please, with confetti on top?"
  },
  {
    "index": 172,
    "text": "[laughs] Okay, then."
  },
  {
    "index": 173,
    "text": "Follow me."
  },
  {
    "index": 174,
    "text": "This is our Surprise Wall."
  },
  {
    "index": 175,
    "text": "You never know what you'll find in here."
  },
  {
    "index": 176,
    "text": "-[chicken clucking]"
  },
  {
    "index": 177,
    "text": "-[Pandy laughs]"
  },
  {
    "index": 178,
    "text": "-[cow mooing]"
  },
  {
    "index": 179,
    "text": "-[Gabby laughs]"
  },
  {
    "index": 180,
    "text": "-[squawks] Surprise Wall!"
  },
  {
    "index": 181,
    "text": "-Whoa!"
  },
  {
    "index": 182,
    "text": "[squawks] I love surprises."
  },
  {
    "index": 183,
    "text": "And over here is our..."
  },
  {
    "index": 184,
    "text": "Glow Wall!"
  },
  {
    "index": 185,
    "text": "Pa-cha!"
  },
  {
    "index": 186,
    "text": "Cat-tastic!"
  },
  {
    "index": 187,
    "text": "Whoa!"
  },
  {
    "index": 188,
    "text": "A glowing Marty!"
  },
  {
    "index": 189,
    "text": "Hello in there."
  },
  {
    "index": 190,
    "text": "[Gabby gasps, laughs]"
  },
  {
    "index": 191,
    "text": "[laughter]"
  },
  {
    "index": 192,
    "text": "Let's check out the Balloon Wall."
  },
  {
    "index": 193,
    "text": "Balloon Wall?"
  },
  {
    "index": 194,
    "text": "Whoa! Hoo-hoo-hoo!"
  },
  {
    "index": 195,
    "text": "I love balloons!"
  },
  {
    "index": 196,
    "text": "You know, I don't mean to brag,"
  },
  {
    "index": 197,
    "text": "but I'm something of a balloon expert."
  },
  {
    "index": 198,
    "text": "-Really?"
  },
  {
    "index": 199,
    "text": "-Oh, yeah."
  },
  {
    "index": 200,
    "text": "Just check out my paw print."
  },
  {
    "index": 201,
    "text": "I'm a bona fide balloon artiste."
  },
  {
    "index": 202,
    "text": "I can make anything out of balloons."
  },
  {
    "index": 203,
    "text": "Just name it."
  },
  {
    "index": 204,
    "text": "How about... a hot dog hat?"
  },
  {
    "index": 205,
    "text": "Coming right up!"
  },
  {
    "index": 206,
    "text": "-There you go."
  },
  {
    "index": 207,
    "text": "-Hot dog!"
  },
  {
    "index": 208,
    "text": "What about you, Gabby?"
  },
  {
    "index": 209,
    "text": "Hmm. I'm thinking..."
  },
  {
    "index": 210,
    "text": "[gasps] ...a balloon monster!"
  },
  {
    "index": 211,
    "text": "Paw-tastic!"
  },
  {
    "index": 212,
    "text": "You got it!"
  },
  {
    "index": 213,
    "text": "[Marty] Hi."
  },
  {
    "index": 214,
    "text": "My name's Balloon Monster. [jabbers]"
  },
  {
    "index": 215,
    "text": "-Oh, he's so cute!"
  },
  {
    "index": 216,
    "text": "-[balloon squeaking]"
  },
  {
    "index": 217,
    "text": "-And squeaky."
  },
  {
    "index": 218,
    "text": "-Oh! I know."
  },
  {
    "index": 219,
    "text": "This one's gonna"
  },
  {
    "index": 220,
    "text": "knock your party socks off."
  },
  {
    "index": 221,
    "text": "What is it?"
  },
  {
    "index": 222,
    "text": "It's a balloon motorcycle!"
  },
  {
    "index": 223,
    "text": "Vroom, vroom!"
  },
  {
    "index": 224,
    "text": "That's paw-esome!"
  },
  {
    "index": 225,
    "text": "Too bad CatRat isn't here."
  },
  {
    "index": 226,
    "text": "He loves motorcycles."
  },
  {
    "index": 227,
    "text": "CatRat? Who's CatRat?"
  },
  {
    "index": 228,
    "text": "-[CatRat chuckles]"
  },
  {
    "index": 229,
    "text": "-[Marty shrieks]"
  },
  {
    "index": 230,
    "text": "Whoa!"
  },
  {
    "index": 231,
    "text": "Uh, what just happened?"
  },
  {
    "index": 232,
    "text": "Whoopsie! I did that."
  },
  {
    "index": 233,
    "text": "Marty!"
  },
  {
    "index": 234,
    "text": "It looks like"
  },
  {
    "index": 235,
    "text": "you sucked up all the color in this room."
  },
  {
    "index": 236,
    "text": "[chuckling] Yeah."
  },
  {
    "index": 237,
    "text": "That's what happens when I get startled."
  },
  {
    "index": 238,
    "text": "Wait a minute."
  },
  {
    "index": 239,
    "text": "You mean to tell me"
  },
  {
    "index": 240,
    "text": "that every time you get startled,"
  },
  {
    "index": 241,
    "text": "this happens?"
  },
  {
    "index": 242,
    "text": "Yep!"
  },
  {
    "index": 243,
    "text": "But don't worry."
  },
  {
    "index": 244,
    "text": "I can fix it. Check this out."
  },
  {
    "index": 245,
    "text": "♪ Whoo-hoo-hoo! ♪"
  },
  {
    "index": 246,
    "text": "Pretty neat, huh?"
  },
  {
    "index": 247,
    "text": "[CatRat] Hmm."
  },
  {
    "index": 248,
    "text": "Oh, hey!"
  },
  {
    "index": 249,
    "text": "Who's that balloony-looking fella"
  },
  {
    "index": 250,
    "text": "over there?"
  },
  {
    "index": 251,
    "text": "Oh! That's Balloon Monster."
  },
  {
    "index": 252,
    "text": "-Boo!"
  },
  {
    "index": 253,
    "text": "-[Marty shrieks]"
  },
  {
    "index": 254,
    "text": "Flying furballs!"
  },
  {
    "index": 255,
    "text": "You got me again, CatRat."
  },
  {
    "index": 256,
    "text": "[horn honks]"
  },
  {
    "index": 257,
    "text": "Phew!"
  },
  {
    "index": 258,
    "text": "That's the coolest thing I've ever seen."
  },
  {
    "index": 259,
    "text": "Whoa! Speaking of cool."
  },
  {
    "index": 260,
    "text": "Who does this baby belong to?"
  },
  {
    "index": 261,
    "text": "Marty made it."
  },
  {
    "index": 262,
    "text": "[CatRat whistles]"
  },
  {
    "index": 263,
    "text": "Mind if I take it for a spin?"
  },
  {
    "index": 264,
    "text": "-Be my guest."
  },
  {
    "index": 265,
    "text": "-Thanks."
  },
  {
    "index": 266,
    "text": "Ha-cha!"
  },
  {
    "index": 267,
    "text": "Now, let's see what this thing can do."
  },
  {
    "index": 268,
    "text": "[engine revving]"
  },
  {
    "index": 269,
    "text": "[CatRat laughs]"
  },
  {
    "index": 270,
    "text": "Wahoo!"
  },
  {
    "index": 271,
    "text": "Yahoo!"
  },
  {
    "index": 272,
    "text": "Hey, Floyd! Check out my new ride!"
  },
  {
    "index": 273,
    "text": "Hey! Whoa!"
  },
  {
    "index": 274,
    "text": "Look with your eyes, Floyd, not your paw!"
  },
  {
    "index": 275,
    "text": "-[air hissing]"
  },
  {
    "index": 276,
    "text": "-Uh-oh!"
  },
  {
    "index": 277,
    "text": "[yelling] I think I have a leak!"
  },
  {
    "index": 278,
    "text": "[screams]"
  },
  {
    "index": 279,
    "text": "[Gabby] CatRat!"
  },
  {
    "index": 280,
    "text": "We have to get out there"
  },
  {
    "index": 281,
    "text": "and help him. But how?"
  },
  {
    "index": 282,
    "text": "-[CatRat shrieks]"
  },
  {
    "index": 283,
    "text": "-Oh! I have an idea! Come on."
  },
  {
    "index": 284,
    "text": "Maybe we can make something"
  },
  {
    "index": 285,
    "text": "out of our new cushions."
  },
  {
    "index": 286,
    "text": "Like what?"
  },
  {
    "index": 287,
    "text": "Hmm. I don't know... yet."
  },
  {
    "index": 288,
    "text": "Let's think."
  },
  {
    "index": 289,
    "text": "What can we make that can blast off..."
  },
  {
    "index": 290,
    "text": "[mimics air whooshing]"
  },
  {
    "index": 291,
    "text": "...and fly through the air?"
  },
  {
    "index": 292,
    "text": "A rocket!"
  },
  {
    "index": 293,
    "text": "Ooh! That'll work."
  },
  {
    "index": 294,
    "text": "One rocket, coming up."
  },
  {
    "index": 295,
    "text": "Ta-da!"
  },
  {
    "index": 296,
    "text": "Hop on."
  },
  {
    "index": 297,
    "text": "Ready?"
  },
  {
    "index": 298,
    "text": "Three, two, one!"
  },
  {
    "index": 299,
    "text": "[in unison] Blastoff!"
  },
  {
    "index": 300,
    "text": "-[Gabby] Whee!"
  },
  {
    "index": 301,
    "text": "-[Pandy] Hi, Floyd."
  },
  {
    "index": 302,
    "text": "-[Floyd meows]"
  },
  {
    "index": 303,
    "text": "-[CatRat] Whoa!"
  },
  {
    "index": 304,
    "text": "[Gabby] There's CatRat!"
  },
  {
    "index": 305,
    "text": "[CatRat screams]"
  },
  {
    "index": 306,
    "text": "A little help over here?"
  },
  {
    "index": 307,
    "text": "I have an idea."
  },
  {
    "index": 308,
    "text": "Grab on, CatRat!"
  },
  {
    "index": 309,
    "text": "[CatRat screams]"
  },
  {
    "index": 310,
    "text": "Oh!"
  },
  {
    "index": 311,
    "text": "Whoa! [whimpers]"
  },
  {
    "index": 312,
    "text": "Oh, wow."
  },
  {
    "index": 313,
    "text": "[air hissing]"
  },
  {
    "index": 314,
    "text": "-[balloon pops]"
  },
  {
    "index": 315,
    "text": "-Phew! I almost got popped."
  },
  {
    "index": 316,
    "text": "-Yeah!"
  },
  {
    "index": 317,
    "text": "-We got you, CatRat."
  },
  {
    "index": 318,
    "text": "That was close."
  },
  {
    "index": 319,
    "text": "-Thanks, Marty."
  },
  {
    "index": 320,
    "text": "-No problem."
  },
  {
    "index": 321,
    "text": "To the party room!"
  },
  {
    "index": 322,
    "text": "Wahoo-hoo!"
  },
  {
    "index": 323,
    "text": "-♪ Ooh-hoo! ♪"
  },
  {
    "index": 324,
    "text": "-[laughter]"
  },
  {
    "index": 325,
    "text": "Now, that's what I call a wild ride."
  },
  {
    "index": 326,
    "text": "And a very impressive"
  },
  {
    "index": 327,
    "text": "use of the Party Tail there, Marty."
  },
  {
    "index": 328,
    "text": "Thanks."
  },
  {
    "index": 329,
    "text": "♪ It's all in the swing ♪"
  },
  {
    "index": 330,
    "text": "Well, you've definitely got"
  },
  {
    "index": 331,
    "text": "a knack for it."
  },
  {
    "index": 332,
    "text": "I think I'm gonna go take a nap."
  },
  {
    "index": 333,
    "text": "See ya."
  },
  {
    "index": 334,
    "text": "-Bye!"
  },
  {
    "index": 335,
    "text": "-Bye, CatRat."
  },
  {
    "index": 336,
    "text": "I love the way"
  },
  {
    "index": 337,
    "text": "you used that Party Tail, Marty."
  },
  {
    "index": 338,
    "text": "Wahoo-hoo! Oh, yeah!"
  },
  {
    "index": 339,
    "text": "Me and my new magic tail here"
  },
  {
    "index": 340,
    "text": "are having a swinging time."
  },
  {
    "index": 341,
    "text": "[Balloon Monster jabbers]"
  },
  {
    "index": 342,
    "text": "[jabbers]"
  },
  {
    "index": 343,
    "text": "Well, fluff my fur!"
  },
  {
    "index": 344,
    "text": "I didn't know the tail could do that."
  },
  {
    "index": 345,
    "text": "[Balloon Monster jabbers]"
  },
  {
    "index": 346,
    "text": "[Gabby laughs]"
  },
  {
    "index": 347,
    "text": "I think Balloon Monster"
  },
  {
    "index": 348,
    "text": "really likes the Party Tail."
  },
  {
    "index": 349,
    "text": "Would you like to give it a try,"
  },
  {
    "index": 350,
    "text": "little guy?"
  },
  {
    "index": 351,
    "text": "[Balloon Monster jabbers]"
  },
  {
    "index": 352,
    "text": "Where's he going?"
  },
  {
    "index": 353,
    "text": "[jabbers]"
  },
  {
    "index": 354,
    "text": "[jabbers]"
  },
  {
    "index": 355,
    "text": "Ooh! Look!"
  },
  {
    "index": 356,
    "text": "I think the Balloon Monster"
  },
  {
    "index": 357,
    "text": "wants us to play a game to find him."
  },
  {
    "index": 358,
    "text": "Hey, I know this game."
  },
  {
    "index": 359,
    "text": "It's a matching game."
  },
  {
    "index": 360,
    "text": "To play, we just have to find"
  },
  {
    "index": 361,
    "text": "the cards that match."
  },
  {
    "index": 362,
    "text": "Let's see."
  },
  {
    "index": 363,
    "text": "A cat."
  },
  {
    "index": 364,
    "text": "And..."
  },
  {
    "index": 365,
    "text": "a party hat."
  },
  {
    "index": 366,
    "text": "No siree, bobcat."
  },
  {
    "index": 367,
    "text": "Those don't match."
  },
  {
    "index": 368,
    "text": "Let's try this one."
  },
  {
    "index": 369,
    "text": "Ooh! A cat!"
  },
  {
    "index": 370,
    "text": "Wait! We just saw the other cat."
  },
  {
    "index": 371,
    "text": "Where was it?"
  },
  {
    "index": 372,
    "text": "Here?"
  },
  {
    "index": 373,
    "text": "Doodly-doo! We have a match!"
  },
  {
    "index": 374,
    "text": "[Balloon Monster jabbers]"
  },
  {
    "index": 375,
    "text": "Let's make another match."
  },
  {
    "index": 376,
    "text": "A pickle and..."
  },
  {
    "index": 377,
    "text": "a party hat."
  },
  {
    "index": 378,
    "text": "Nope. No match there."
  },
  {
    "index": 379,
    "text": "A pickle!"
  },
  {
    "index": 380,
    "text": "Now, where was the other pickle?"
  },
  {
    "index": 381,
    "text": "Right here!"
  },
  {
    "index": 382,
    "text": "Well, wiggle my whiskers. We got it!"
  },
  {
    "index": 383,
    "text": "[Balloon Monster jabbers]"
  },
  {
    "index": 384,
    "text": "We just need to make one more match."
  },
  {
    "index": 385,
    "text": "I think we know what these will be."
  },
  {
    "index": 386,
    "text": "Party hat and..."
  },
  {
    "index": 387,
    "text": "a party hat!"
  },
  {
    "index": 388,
    "text": "Whoo-hoo-hoo-hoo-hoo!"
  },
  {
    "index": 389,
    "text": "-[Balloon Monster jabbers tauntingly]"
  },
  {
    "index": 390,
    "text": "-[Gabby] Whoa!"
  },
  {
    "index": 391,
    "text": "There he goes!"
  },
  {
    "index": 392,
    "text": "That's one speedy Balloon Monster."
  },
  {
    "index": 393,
    "text": "[jabbers]"
  },
  {
    "index": 394,
    "text": "[gasps] To the Glow Wall!"
  },
  {
    "index": 395,
    "text": "Whoa!"
  },
  {
    "index": 396,
    "text": "Check it out!"
  },
  {
    "index": 397,
    "text": "We're glowing!"
  },
  {
    "index": 398,
    "text": "[Balloon Monster jabbers]"
  },
  {
    "index": 399,
    "text": "[Gabby] Look! There's the Balloon Monster,"
  },
  {
    "index": 400,
    "text": "way up at the top of that slide."
  },
  {
    "index": 401,
    "text": "[Balloon Monster jabbers tauntingly]"
  },
  {
    "index": 402,
    "text": "And he still has the Party Tail!"
  },
  {
    "index": 403,
    "text": "I'm on it."
  },
  {
    "index": 404,
    "text": "[jabbers]"
  },
  {
    "index": 405,
    "text": "[Gabby] Uh-oh! The Balloon Monster"
  },
  {
    "index": 406,
    "text": "is rolling down a big, neon party hoop."
  },
  {
    "index": 407,
    "text": "[Marty] We have to help Pandy."
  },
  {
    "index": 408,
    "text": "Come on!"
  },
  {
    "index": 409,
    "text": "Uh-oh!"
  },
  {
    "index": 410,
    "text": "Got it!"
  },
  {
    "index": 411,
    "text": "Phew! Thanks, Marty."
  },
  {
    "index": 412,
    "text": "How did you learn to party-hoop like that?"
  },
  {
    "index": 413,
    "text": "I'm a Party Cat, remember?"
  },
  {
    "index": 414,
    "text": "It's all in the wiggle."
  },
  {
    "index": 415,
    "text": "[jabbers]"
  },
  {
    "index": 416,
    "text": "[gasps] I think"
  },
  {
    "index": 417,
    "text": "we've got more party hoops coming."
  },
  {
    "index": 418,
    "text": "Marty, how many hoops can you do at once?"
  },
  {
    "index": 419,
    "text": "Well, I've never tried more than one,"
  },
  {
    "index": 420,
    "text": "but let's find out."
  },
  {
    "index": 421,
    "text": "Count with me."
  },
  {
    "index": 422,
    "text": "One!"
  },
  {
    "index": 423,
    "text": "Two!"
  },
  {
    "index": 424,
    "text": "Three!"
  },
  {
    "index": 425,
    "text": "Four!"
  },
  {
    "index": 426,
    "text": "Five!"
  },
  {
    "index": 427,
    "text": "Six!"
  },
  {
    "index": 428,
    "text": "Whoo-hoo-hoo-hoo!"
  },
  {
    "index": 429,
    "text": "Six party hoops at once?"
  },
  {
    "index": 430,
    "text": "♪ Whoo-hoo-hoo! ♪"
  },
  {
    "index": 431,
    "text": "That's my new record!"
  },
  {
    "index": 432,
    "text": "Now, what do you say, Balloon Monster?"
  },
  {
    "index": 433,
    "text": "Can we have that Party Tail back now?"
  },
  {
    "index": 434,
    "text": "[Balloon Monster jabbers]"
  },
  {
    "index": 435,
    "text": "Thanks."
  },
  {
    "index": 436,
    "text": "[Balloon Monster sighs]"
  },
  {
    "index": 437,
    "text": "Aww! I know you really liked"
  },
  {
    "index": 438,
    "text": "playing with the Party tail, buddy."
  },
  {
    "index": 439,
    "text": "Hey!"
  },
  {
    "index": 440,
    "text": "Why don't I make you one of your very own?"
  },
  {
    "index": 441,
    "text": "Here you go."
  },
  {
    "index": 442,
    "text": "[Balloon Monster jabbers excitedly]"
  },
  {
    "index": 443,
    "text": "[horn honks]"
  },
  {
    "index": 444,
    "text": "Nice job, Marty."
  },
  {
    "index": 445,
    "text": "Now, what do you say"
  },
  {
    "index": 446,
    "text": "we get back to the party room?"
  },
  {
    "index": 447,
    "text": "Let's do it."
  },
  {
    "index": 448,
    "text": "See you later, Balloon Monster."
  },
  {
    "index": 449,
    "text": "-[Balloon Monster jabbers]"
  },
  {
    "index": 450,
    "text": "-Whoo-hoo-hoo!"
  },
  {
    "index": 451,
    "text": "Wow, Marty."
  },
  {
    "index": 452,
    "text": "You sure are an a-meow-zing hooper."
  },
  {
    "index": 453,
    "text": "Thanks, Pandy. Want to give it a whirl?"
  },
  {
    "index": 454,
    "text": "You know it!"
  },
  {
    "index": 455,
    "text": "Check me out!"
  },
  {
    "index": 456,
    "text": "Looking good, Pandy pal."
  },
  {
    "index": 457,
    "text": "Just remember, it's all in the wiggle."
  },
  {
    "index": 458,
    "text": "[humming tune]"
  },
  {
    "index": 459,
    "text": "Aww! Marty is such a sweetie,"
  },
  {
    "index": 460,
    "text": "don't you think?"
  },
  {
    "index": 461,
    "text": "And he definitely loves that Party Tail."
  },
  {
    "index": 462,
    "text": "It's like he belongs here."
  },
  {
    "index": 463,
    "text": "[gasps]"
  },
  {
    "index": 464,
    "text": "I just had a great idea!"
  },
  {
    "index": 465,
    "text": "Should we invite Marty to live here,"
  },
  {
    "index": 466,
    "text": "in the party room?"
  },
  {
    "index": 467,
    "text": "Ooh! He's going to be so excited!"
  },
  {
    "index": 468,
    "text": "Hey, Marty..."
  },
  {
    "index": 469,
    "text": "You called?"
  },
  {
    "index": 470,
    "text": "-How would you..."
  },
  {
    "index": 471,
    "text": "-[gasps]"
  },
  {
    "index": 472,
    "text": "-...like to live up here..."
  },
  {
    "index": 473,
    "text": "-[gasps]"
  },
  {
    "index": 474,
    "text": "...in the Dollhouse party room,"
  },
  {
    "index": 475,
    "text": "with me and all the Gabby Cats?"
  },
  {
    "index": 476,
    "text": "[gasps] Really?"
  },
  {
    "index": 477,
    "text": "What do you say, Marty? Will you stay?"
  },
  {
    "index": 478,
    "text": "Pretty, pretty please?"
  },
  {
    "index": 479,
    "text": "With confetti on top?"
  },
  {
    "index": 480,
    "text": "Me, live here in the Dollhouse with you?"
  },
  {
    "index": 481,
    "text": "I'd love to!"
  },
  {
    "index": 482,
    "text": "Aww! This is just the best day ever."
  },
  {
    "index": 483,
    "text": "I think this calls for a party."
  },
  {
    "index": 484,
    "text": "A Marty party!"
  },
  {
    "index": 485,
    "text": "You know what to do."
  },
  {
    "index": 486,
    "text": "You bet I do!"
  },
  {
    "index": 487,
    "text": "[horn honks]"
  },
  {
    "index": 488,
    "text": "♪ Whoo-hoo! ♪"
  },
  {
    "index": 489,
    "text": "Wow! A Marty-themed party room."
  },
  {
    "index": 490,
    "text": "Paw-esome!"
  },
  {
    "index": 491,
    "text": "[over PA] Calling all Gabby Cats!"
  },
  {
    "index": 492,
    "text": "Head on up to the party room,"
  },
  {
    "index": 493,
    "text": "'cause we're having a Marty party!"
  },
  {
    "index": 494,
    "text": "-[party horns honking]"
  },
  {
    "index": 495,
    "text": "-Happy Marty Party!"
  },
  {
    "index": 496,
    "text": "Thanks, Cat-A-Vator."
  },
  {
    "index": 497,
    "text": "-[giggles] Oh, hooray!"
  },
  {
    "index": 498,
    "text": "-Hey!"
  },
  {
    "index": 499,
    "text": "-Welcome!"
  },
  {
    "index": 500,
    "text": "-Hi, Marty."
  },
  {
    "index": 501,
    "text": "Come on, kitty cats."
  },
  {
    "index": 502,
    "text": "Let's give Marty"
  },
  {
    "index": 503,
    "text": "a Dollhouse Family welcome."
  },
  {
    "index": 504,
    "text": "Wahoo-hoo!"
  },
  {
    "index": 505,
    "text": "Whoo! Wahoo!"
  },
  {
    "index": 506,
    "text": "Whee!"
  },
  {
    "index": 507,
    "text": "-Wahoo!"
  },
  {
    "index": 508,
    "text": "-[laughter]"
  },
  {
    "index": 509,
    "text": "Whoo!"
  },
  {
    "index": 510,
    "text": "[party horn honks]"
  },
  {
    "index": 511,
    "text": "♪ Hello, welcome, new friend Marty ♪"
  },
  {
    "index": 512,
    "text": "♪ Can't wait to throw a party ♪"
  },
  {
    "index": 513,
    "text": "♪ Let's make it a Marty party today ♪"
  },
  {
    "index": 514,
    "text": "Meow!"
  },
  {
    "index": 515,
    "text": "♪ With balloons"
  },
  {
    "index": 516,
    "text": "And party hoops we'll play ♪"
  },
  {
    "index": 517,
    "text": "♪ We'll bop and pop the day away ♪"
  },
  {
    "index": 518,
    "text": "♪ 'Cause Marty's here to stay ♪"
  },
  {
    "index": 519,
    "text": "You know it!"
  },
  {
    "index": 520,
    "text": "♪ So happy for you ♪"
  },
  {
    "index": 521,
    "text": "♪ Now you're living here too ♪"
  },
  {
    "index": 522,
    "text": "-♪ So nice to meet you ♪"
  },
  {
    "index": 523,
    "text": "-♪ Aww! So nice to meet you ♪"
  },
  {
    "index": 524,
    "text": "♪ Oh, welcome to the party room ♪"
  },
  {
    "index": 525,
    "text": "-♪ It's such a swinging place ♪"
  },
  {
    "index": 526,
    "text": "-♪ To party! ♪"
  },
  {
    "index": 527,
    "text": "-♪ I wouldn't have it any other way ♪"
  },
  {
    "index": 528,
    "text": "-♪ Doo-doo, doodly-doo! ♪"
  },
  {
    "index": 529,
    "text": "♪ So swing that Party Tail ♪"
  },
  {
    "index": 530,
    "text": "♪ That Marty Tail"
  },
  {
    "index": 531,
    "text": "Is, oh, so party-riffic ♪"
  },
  {
    "index": 532,
    "text": "♪ Welcome to the Dollhouse Family ♪"
  },
  {
    "index": 533,
    "text": "♪ Doodly-doo! ♪"
  },
  {
    "index": 534,
    "text": "♪ Yeah, welcome to the Dollhouse Family ♪"
  },
  {
    "index": 535,
    "text": "Wahoo-hoo! Aww!"
  },
  {
    "index": 536,
    "text": "I think I'm gonna love it here."
  },
  {
    "index": 537,
    "text": "[in unison] Whoo!"
  },
  {
    "index": 538,
    "text": "Yay, Marty!"
  },
  {
    "index": 539,
    "text": "Looks like"
  },
  {
    "index": 540,
    "text": "we're gonna have a lot more parties."
  },
  {
    "index": 541,
    "text": "Wahoo-hoo-hoo!"
  },
  {
    "index": 542,
    "text": "[Gabby laughs]"
  },
  {
    "index": 543,
    "text": "Are you ready for one more surprise?"
  },
  {
    "index": 544,
    "text": "You know it!"
  },
  {
    "index": 545,
    "text": "[gong crashes]"
  },
  {
    "index": 546,
    "text": "♪ Gabby Cat, Gabby Cat ♪"
  },
  {
    "index": 547,
    "text": "♪ Gabby Cat, Gabby Cat ♪"
  },
  {
    "index": 548,
    "text": "♪ Gabby Cat, Gabby Cat ♪"
  },
  {
    "index": 549,
    "text": "♪ Gabby Cat, Gabby Cat ♪"
  },
  {
    "index": 550,
    "text": "♪ Gabby Cat, Gabby Cat"
  },
  {
    "index": 551,
    "text": "Gabby Cat, Gabby Cat ♪"
  },
  {
    "index": 552,
    "text": "♪ Gabby Cat of the Day! ♪"
  },
  {
    "index": 553,
    "text": "It's me, Marty the Party Cat!"
  },
  {
    "index": 554,
    "text": "-♪ Sound the meow alarm ♪"
  },
  {
    "index": 555,
